103"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En103Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Cic.Sest." /><gams:textualContent>Quo modo tardiores sunt et  principiis rerum neglectis ad  extremum  ipsa denique necessitate excitantur.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En103Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En103Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En103Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En103Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En103Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text> principiis rerum neglectis ad  extremum </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|principiis|mp] rerum [v|neglectis|neglegere|is] [p|ad|ad]  [a|extremum|extremus|ananmnpn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En103Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>principiis</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En103Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>neglectis</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#neglegere" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.o