mos militum mulceret, seu conscium Othonis credebat, ad  postremum vel odio.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En204Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En204Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En204Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text>Agitasse Laco ignaro Galba de occidendo Tito Vinio dicitur, sive ut poena eius animos militum mulceret, seu conscium Othonis credebat, ad  postremum vel odio</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Agitasse Laco ignaro Galba de occidendo Tito Vinio dicitur, sive ut poena eius animos militum mulceret, seu conscium Othonis credebat, [p|ad|ad]  [a|postremum|postremus|anSntnpn] vel odio</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En204Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>postremum</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#postremus" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#NeuterSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Preposition rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En204Ph1Pe1"><aaif:text>ad</aaif:te