urce="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Apul.Socr." /><gams:textualContent>Sed  cumprimis  mirandum est, quod ea, quae minime videri volunt nescire, discere tamen neglegunt et eiusdem artis disciplinam simul et ignorantiam detrectant.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En323Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En323Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En323Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En323Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text>Sed  cumprimis  mirandum est</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Sed [p||cum] [a|cumprimis|primus|anvntnpn]  [v|mirandum|mirare|is] est</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En323Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mirandum</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mirare" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En323Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cumprimis</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#primus" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#NeuterSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Preposition rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En323Ph1Pe1"><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cum" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:contracted rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:contracted></aaif:Preposition><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En324"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En324Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Gell." /><gams:textualContent>Nos deinde eum tenebamus urgebamusque, et   cumprimis Apollinaris, ut de vocabulorum istorum uel differentia vel, si ei ita videretur, similitudine plenius apertiusque dissereret .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En324Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En324Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En324Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En324Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text>  cumprimis Apollinaris, ut de vocabulorum istorum uel differentia vel, si ei ita videretur, similitudine plenius apertiusque dissereret </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [p||cum] [a|cumprimis|primus|anvntnpn] Apollinaris, ut de vocabulorum istorum uel differentia vel, si ei ita videretur, similitudine plenius apertiusque [v|dissereret|disserere|is] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En324Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dissereret</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#disserere" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En324Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cumprimis</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#primus" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#NeuterSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Preposition rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En324Ph1Pe1"><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cum" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:contracted rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:contracted></aaif:Preposition><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En325"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En325Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Gell." /><gams:textualContent>Illud vero  cumprimis apud Homerum veteres grammatici adnotaverunt , quod, cum dixisset quodam in loco κολοιούς τε ψῆράς τε, alio in loco non ψηρῶν, set ψαρῶν dixit.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En325Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En325Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En325Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En325Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En325Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text>Illud vero  cumprimis apud Homerum veteres grammatici adnotaverunt </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Illud vero [p||cum] [a|cumprimis|primus|anvntnpn] apud Homerum veteres [s|grammatici|mp] [v|adnotaverunt|adnotare|ts] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En325Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>grammatici</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En325Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>adnotaverunt</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#adnotare" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En325Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cumprimis</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#primus" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#NeuterSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Preposition rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En325Ph1Pe1"><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cum" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:contracted rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:contracted></aaif:Preposition><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En326"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En326Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Gell." /><gams:textualContent> Adhibebat nobis auctoritates nobilium medicorum et  cumprimis Aristotelis philosophi, rei omnis humanae 