ps://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Plin.nat." /><gams:textualContent> E diverso  ciet cyclamini radix pota et adposita et vesicae insidentium decocto medetur.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En638Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En638Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En638Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En638Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text> E diverso  ciet cyclamini radix</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [p|E|e] [a|diverso|diversus|anSndnpn]  [v|ciet|ciere|ts] cyclamini radix</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En638Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ciet</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ciere" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En638Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>diverso</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#diversus" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#NeuterSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype