about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En833Ph1Pe1"><aaif:text>ex</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ex" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:contracted rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:contracted></aaif:Preposition><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En834"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En834Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Plin.nat." /><gams:textualContent>Velut sui cadaveris agnitionem fugientes,  conveniunt que ex  alto etiam ad quosdam odores, ut saepiam ustam et polypum, quae ideo coiciuntur in nassas.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En834Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En834Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En834Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En834Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text> conveniunt que ex  alto etiam ad quosdam odores</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|conveniunt|convenire|is] que [p|ex|ex]  [a|alto|altus|anvnlnpn] etiam ad quosdam odores</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En834Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>conveniunt</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#convenire" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https: