:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En1045Ph1Pe1"><aaif:text>Ex</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ex" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:contracted rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:contracted></aaif:Preposition><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En1046"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En1046Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Gaius.inst." /><gams:textualContent>Et ex  diverso si ex ea causa, ex qua nobis edicto praetoris datur actio, Romae sub uno iudice inter omnes cives Romanos accipiatur iudicium, legitimum est.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En1046Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En1046Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En1046Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En1046Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text>Et ex  diverso si ex ea causa, ex qua nobis edicto praetoris datur actio, Romae sub uno iudice inter omnes cives Romanos accipiatur iudicium</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Et [p|ex|ex]  [a|diverso|diversus|anSnmnpn] si ex ea causa, ex qua nobis edicto praetoris datur actio, Romae sub uno iudice inter omnes cives Romanos [v|accipiatur|accipere|ts] iudicium</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En1046Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>accipiatur</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#accipere" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http: