Quae est igitur in  medio belli causa posita ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2018Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2018Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2018Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2018Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2018Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text> Quae est igitur in  medio belli causa posita </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [s|Quae|fp] est igitur [p|in|in]  [a|medio|medius|anvnlnpn] belli causa [v|posita|ponere|is] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2018Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>Quae</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Feminine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Plural" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2018Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>posita</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ponere" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2018Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>medio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#medius" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#NeuterSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Preposition rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2018Ph1Pe1"><aaif:text>in</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#in" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:contracted rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:contracted></aaif:Preposition><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2019"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2019Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Cic.inv." /><gams:textualContent>Atque hic quidem ipse et sese ipsum nobis et eos, qui ante fuerunt,  in medio  posuit , ut ceteros et se ipsum per se cognosceremus.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2019Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2019Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2019Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2019Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text> in medio  posuit </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [p|in|in] [a|medio|medius|anvnlnpn]  [v|posuit|ponere|ts] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2019Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>posuit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ponere" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2019Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>medio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#medius" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#NeuterSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Preposition rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2019Ph1Pe1"><aaif:text>in</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#in" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:contracted rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:contracted></aaif:Preposition><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2020"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2020Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Cic.deOrat." /><gams:textualContent>Dicendi autem omnis ratio in medio  posita  communi quodam in usu atque in hominum ore et sermone versatur.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2020Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2020Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2020Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2020Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text>omnis ratio in medio  posita </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>omnis ratio [p|in|in] [a|medio|medius|anvnlnpn]  [v|posita|ponere|is] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2020Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>posita</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ponere" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2020Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>medio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#medius" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#NeuterSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Preposition rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2020Ph1Pe1"><aaif:text>in</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#in" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:contracted rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:contracted></aaif:Preposition><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2021"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2021Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Cic.Tusc." /><gams:textualContent>Nam et obscenas voluptates, de quibus multa ab illis habetur oratio, facilis communis in medio  sitas esse dicunt.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2021Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2021Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2021Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2021Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text>facilis communis in medio  sitas esse dicunt</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>facilis communis [p|in|in] [a|medio|medius|anvnlnpn]  [v|sitas|sinere|is] esse dicunt</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2021Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sitas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sinere" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2021Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>medio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#medius" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#NeuterSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Preposition rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2021Ph1Pe1"><aaif:text>in</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#in" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:contracted rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:contracted></aaif:Preposition><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2022"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2022Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Cic.NatDeor." /><gams:textualContent>Sed iam, ut omni me invidia liberem,  ponam  in  medio sententias philosophorum de natura deorum.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2022Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2022Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2022Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2022Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text> ponam  in  medio sententias philosophorum de natura deorum</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|ponam|ponere|ts]  [p|in|in]  [a|medio|medius|anvnlnpn] sententias philosophorum de natura deorum</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2022Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ponam</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ponere" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2022Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>medio</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#medius" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated 