stituat , percipere debet in annos singulos mille nongentos quinquaginta sestertios nummos.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2338Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2338Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2338Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2338Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2338Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text>ut in  perpetuum praedictam usuram semissium dominus constituat </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ut [p|in|in]  [a|perpetuum|perpetuus|anvnmnpn] praedictam usuram semissium [s|dominus|ms] [v|constituat|constituere|ts] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Subject rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2338Ph1Su1"><aaif:text>dominus</aaif:text><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:gender rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Masculine" /><aaif:number rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Singular" /><aaif:overt rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:overt></aaif:Subject><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2338Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>constituat</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#constituere" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2338Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>perpetuum</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#perpetuus" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#NeuterSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Preposition rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2338Ph1Pe1"><aaif:text>in</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#in" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:contracted rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:contracted></aaif:Preposition><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2339"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2339Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Colum." /><gams:textualContent>Atque haec ratio bene institutarum vinearum in perpetuum  custodienda erit.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2339Ph1"><aaif:subject rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2339Ph1Su1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2339Ph1Ve1" /><a