Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2885Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>primis</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#primus" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#NeuterSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Preposition rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2885Ph1Pe1"><aaif:text>in</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#in" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:contracted rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:contracted></aaif:Preposition><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2886"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2886Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Quint.inst." /><gams:textualContent>Cetera admonitione magna egent,  in  primis ut tenerae mentes tracturaeque altius quidquid rudibus et omnium ignaris insederit non modo quae diserta sed vel magis quae honesta sunt discant.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2886Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2886Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2886Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text> in  primis ut tenerae mentes tracturaeque altius quidquid rudibus et omnium ignaris insederit non modo quae diserta sed vel magis quae honesta sunt discant</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [p|in|in]  [a|primis|primus|anSnqnpn] ut tenerae mentes tracturaeque altius quidquid rudibus et omnium ignaris insederit non modo quae diserta sed vel magis quae honesta sunt discant</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2886Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>primis</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#primus" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#NeuterSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Sentence" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Preposition rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2886Ph1Pe1"><aaif:text>in</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#in" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:contracted rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:contracted></aaif:Preposition><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2887"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2887Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Quint.inst." /><gams:textualContent>Multum autem veteres etiam Latini conferunt, quamquam plerique plus ingenio quam arte valuerunt, in  primis copiam verborum.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2887Ph1"><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2887Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2887Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text>Multum autem veteres etiam Latini conferunt, quamquam plerique plus ingenio quam arte valuerunt, in  primis copiam verborum</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Multum autem veteres etiam Latini conferunt, quamquam plerique plus ingenio quam arte valuerunt, [p|in|in]  [a|primis|primus|annnqnpn] copiam verborum</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2887Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>primis</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#primus" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#NeuterSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Noun" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Preposition rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2887Ph1Pe1"><aaif:text>in</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#in" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:contracted rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:contracted></aaif:Preposition><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2888"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2888Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Quint.inst." /><gams:textualContent> In  primis vitia si qua sunt oris emendet , ut expressa sint verba, ut suis quaeque litterae sonis enuntientur.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2888Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2888Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2888Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2888Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text> In  primis vitia si qua sunt oris emendet </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [p|In|in]  [a|primis|primus|anvnqnpn] vitia si qua sunt oris [v|emendet|emendare|ts] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En2888Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>emendet</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#emendare" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:dataty