rma in proximo  sedens </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Quidam eximia magnitudine et forma [p|in|in] [a|proximo|proximus|anvnlnpn]  [v|sedens|sedere|is] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3130Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>sedens</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sedere" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3130Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>proximo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#proximus" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#NeuterSingular" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Preposition rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3130Ph1Pe1"><aaif:text>in</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#in" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:contracted rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:contracted></aaif:Preposition><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3131"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3131Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif.bibl#Suet.Iul." /><gams:textualContent>Non enim ubique ac semper, sed cum hostis in proximo  esset , coercebat.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3131Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3131Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3131Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3131Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text>sed cum hostis in proximo  esset </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>sed cum hostis [p|in|in] [a|proximo|proximus|anvnlnpn]  [v|esset|esse|is] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3131Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>esset</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#esse" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3131Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>proximo</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#proximus" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/200