xtualContent>Nunc detrectasse nominatim antiquos oratores contentus neminem sequentium laudare ausus est nisi in  publicum et in commune, veritus credo, ne multos offenderet.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3271Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3271Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3271Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3271Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text>Nunc detrectasse nominatim antiquos oratores contentus neminem sequentium laudare ausus est nisi in  publicum et in commune</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Nunc detrectasse nominatim antiquos oratores contentus neminem sequentium laudare [v|ausus|audere|ts] est nisi [p|in|in]  [a|publicum|publicus|anvnmnpn] et in commune</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3271Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ausus</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#audere" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ltpaaif#En3271Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>publicum</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#publicus" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif: